# Follow User Requests Only

## Do NOT implement without explicit request

Do NOT implement features, UI changes, or scope expansion unless the user explicitly requests it in the **current message**.

- Recommendations and docs are OK when asked; **code changes only when the user asks to implement**
- Do not add "helpful" extras (spec cards, mock business fields, pitch copy) without explicit approval
- When the user asks for advice, research, or a report only — deliver text/docs, **no code**
- Minimize scope; if unclear, **ask before coding**

## Examples

| User says | Do | Do not |
|-----------|-----|--------|
| "Write a pitch doc" | Create/update markdown in `docs/` | Add UI cards or mock spec data |
| "How should we structure approvals?" | Explain in text | Build a new approvals component |
| "Revert the spec card" | Revert the code | Also refactor unrelated files |
